### TaskFlow 完整请求流程
### 适用于 VS Code REST Client 等支持 named request response reference 的 .http 客户端。
### 请从上到下执行。{{$guid}} 让注册邮箱每轮不同；登录邮箱从注册响应中读取。

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@password = LearnNest123!
@displayName = Nest 学习者
@studentEmail = student-{{$guid}}@example.com
@otherEmail = other-{{$guid}}@example.com

### 0. 公开课程入口
# @name welcome
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: api-http-welcome

### 0.1 Liveness：只检查进程能否回应
# @name live
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### 0.2 Readiness：同时检查数据库
# @name ready
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### 1. 注册；返回 { accessToken, user }
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{studentEmail}}",
  "displayName": "{{displayName}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. 登录；使用注册响应中的规范化邮箱
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{register.response.body.$.user.email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 后续受保护请求使用登录响应 token
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3. 查看当前用户
# @name me
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. 创建项目；返回的 id 在响应根级
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "系统学习 NestJS",
  "description": "用 TaskFlow 串起 Controller、DI、数据库和认证"
}

@projectId = {{createProject.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. 当前用户的项目列表
# @name listProjects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. 项目详情
# @name getProject
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. 部分更新项目
# @name updateProject
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "深入学习 NestJS",
  "description": "已经进入累计项目实践"
}

### 8. 在项目中创建任务
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "完成 Controller 课程",
  "description": "能解释 path、query、body 与 HTTP 状态码",
  "status": "todo",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-01T12:00:00.000Z"
}

@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.$.id}}

### 9. 创建第二个任务，便于观察筛选和排序
# @name createSecondTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "复习依赖注入",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "priority": "medium"
}

### 10. 分页任务列表；响应为 { data, meta }
# @name listTasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?page=1&limit=10&sortBy=createdAt&order=DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. 组合筛选：高优先级且未开始
# @name filterTasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?status=todo&priority=high&sortBy=dueDate&order=ASC
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. 任务详情
# @name getTask
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. 更新状态并清空截止日期
# @name updateTask
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "done",
  "dueDate": null
}

### 14. 故意失败：无 token 访问受保护接口，应为 401
# @name unauthenticatedProjects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: api-http-expected-401

### 15. 故意失败：多余 ownerId 且 name 太短，应为 400
# @name invalidProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: api-http-expected-400

{
  "name": "x",
  "ownerId": "客户端无权指定"
}

### 16. 注册另一位用户，用于验证资源所有权
# @name otherRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{otherEmail}}",
  "displayName": "另一位用户",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@otherAccessToken = {{otherRegister.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 17. 故意失败：另一位用户读取第一个用户的项目；本项目以 404 隐藏资源存在性
# @name crossUserProject
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: api-http-expected-owner-boundary

### 18. 删除任务；成功为 204 且无响应体
# @name deleteTask
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 19. 故意失败：读取刚删除的任务，应为 404
# @name deletedTask
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: api-http-expected-404

### 20. 删除项目；会级联删除仍属于它的任务，成功为 204
# @name deleteProject
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
